WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.260
Why is 2⁰ equal to 1?

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.970
Follow the pattern.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.440
2³ = 8

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.400
2² = 4

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.490
2¹ = 2

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.820
Each step halves.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.040
Halve again, and you get 1.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.013
So 2⁰ = 1.
